erity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Update GC telemetry examples to include jvm.gc.cause](#discussion_r4231716193) \u00b7 New\n</details>\n\n\ud83e\udde0 **Review effort:** Balanced","comment_id":null,"key":"review:5472029729","kind":"body","line":null,"path":null,"review_id":5472029729},{"body":"[General] This makes `jvm.gc.cause` unconditional, but the current-behavior examples in `instrumentation/runtime-telemetry/library/README.md:223-253` still show every `jvm.gc.duration` point with only `jvm.gc.action` and `jvm.gc.name`. Those examples now misdescribe the emitted attribute set; update them to include representative `jvm.gc.cause` values (or explicitly state that the value varies by collection).","comment_commit_id":"1a2f1414833f6f00849539829399247e8460c2a7","comment_id":4231716193,"key":"inline:4231716193","kind":"inline","line":127,"original_commit_id":"1a2f1414833f6f00849539829399247e8460c2a7","original_line":127,"path":"instrumentation/runtime-telemetry/library/src/main/java/io/opentelemetry/instrumentation/runtimetelemetry/internal/GarbageCollector.java","review_commit_id":"1a2f1414833f6f00849539829399247e8460c2a7","review_id":5472029729,"review_submitted_at":"2026-10-09T15:22:50Z","root_author":{"id":175728472,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCnlnWA","type":"Bot"},"thread_context":[{"author":{"id":175728472,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCnlnWA","type":"Bot"},"body_hash":"9e885f473e43cf00f69008f9b8ffa2eb8245f46815f426e5835f21ad271b7e93","id":4231716193,"parent":null,"updated_at":"2026-10-09T15:22:50Z"}],"thread_id":"PRRT_kwDODJKVX86q1vuz"}],"frozen_at":1791561364,"frozen_at_iso":"2026-10-09T15:56:04Z","frozen_sha":"1a2f1414833f6f00849539829399247e8460c2a7","head_ref":"trask-runtime-telemetry-stabilization","head_repo":"open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation","head_repo_id":210933087,"input_mode":"direct","launch_run":{"actor_id":218610,"attempt":1,"id":37955365012},"loop_kind":"copilot_review","mode":"publish","pr":20376,"protocol":"git-can